# Vulnerabilities accepted for the API image, with a reason and a date each.
#
# The pipeline fails on HIGH and CRITICAL findings that have a fix available
# (`ignore-unfixed: true`), so an entry here is a deliberate, reviewable
# decision — not a way to quiet the scanner. Every line must say why it is
# acceptable and when it was accepted, and unfixed entries should be revisited
# whenever the base image moves.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-2025-12345  # <why it does not apply here> — accepted YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Empty on purpose: the image currently has no accepted exceptions.
